  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Documents private-ingress forwarding with an environment configuration example, package-owned middleware, one-hop client IP normalization before rate limiting, edge proxy responsibilities and the separate Identity pipeline. NuGet README and the offline interactive guide explain TrustAllProxies, strict defaults and preserved host, origin, CORS, CSRF and authentication checks. Runtime behavior is unchanged from 8.1.3.",
